{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434890/extras/overviewsteam.png?t=1744132541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mythic Mire is an RPG with a horror aesthetic and dark surreal vibes. Turn-based battles and light environmental puzzling await. Experience the liminal locations and and quirky NPC\u2019s within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434890/extras/miregifA.gif?t=1744132541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434890/extras/storysteam.png?t=1744132541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faeya is a courageous canid who is driven to find out why her fellow villagers were murdered and to bring them back to life, if she can. Along her way she finds 3 digital \u201cPixies\u201d who become her companions, each with a unique power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434890/extras/miregifB.gif?t=1744132541\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434890/extras/featuressteam.png?t=1744132541\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JRPG structure</strong>, with turn-based battles and 4 party members to control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro CGI FMV</strong> sequences like those from the PS1-era, used in cutscenes and spell animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival horror-style puzzles</strong> where you find clues and answers in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative abilities</strong> for each party member that add strategy and minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Eclectic soundtrack </strong>featuring dark, moody atmospheres and head-banging metal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-drawn pixel art</strong> to tickle your fancy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cute animal-people</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Surreal worlds</strong> with dream-like and nightmarish creatures... and eccentric NPC\u2019s!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434890/extras/heart_banner.gif?t=1744132541\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434890/extras/darkness.gif?t=1744132541\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434890?t=1744132541","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434890?t=1744132541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434890/8946a5dad604507224070f6faf5afd8a9b64e3a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744132541","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434890/8946a5dad604507224070f6faf5afd8a9b64e3a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744132541","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Blood, Surreal Body Horror, Death, Swearing."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434890/extras/overviewsteam.png?t=1744132541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mythic Mire is an RPG with a horror aesthetic and dark surreal vibes. Turn-based battles and light environmental puzzling await. Experience the liminal locations and and quirky NPC\u2019s within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\